  "version": "other",
  "operative_text": "(a_in_person_id)\n(section) Sec. 1: Section 16-411, Arizona Revised Statutes, is amended to read: (para 4)\n(quote) A voting center shall allow any voter in that county to receive the appropriate ballot for that voter on election day after presenting identification as prescribed in section 16-579 and to lawfully cast the ballot.\n(section) Sec. 2: Section 16-542, Arizona Revised Statutes, is amended to read: (para A)\n(quote) Any on-site early voting location or other early voting location shall require each elector to present identification as prescribed in section 16-579 before receiving a ballot.\n(section) Sec. 2: Section 16-542, Arizona Revised Statutes, is amended to read: (para E)\n(quote) An elector who appears personally no later than 5:00 p.m. on the Friday preceding the election at an on‑site early voting location that is established by the county recorder or other officer in charge of elections shall be given a ballot after presenting identification as prescribed in section 16-579 and shall be permitted to vote at the on‑site location.\n(b_no_id_remedy) not stated.\n(c_mail_ballot_id) not stated.\n(d_proof_of_citizenship) not stated.\n(e_other_rule) not stated.\n(other) 0: n\n(other) 1: o\n(other) 2: t\n(other) 3:  \n(other) 4: s\n(other) 5: t\n(other) 6: a\n(other) 7: t\n(other) 8: e\n(other) 9: d",
